UID:ci16639652-tt28494031--2024-12-8-5-0
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 1h 51m (111 mins)\n\nFollows 5 teenagers from small-
 town Oregon who\, with high school in the rearview\, decide to embark on o
 ne last adventure: to make it to a place they've never been -the Pacific c
 oast\, 500 miles away. Their plan\, in full: &quot\;F**k it.&quot\;\n\nhtt
 ps://www.imdb.com/title/tt28494031/\n\nIMDb rating: 6.3
